        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Émile Driant\n- Events: Battle of Verdun, World War I\n- Organizations: German Army, French Army\n\nFacts:\n- The Battle of Verdun was fought between the German Army and the French Army on the Western Front during World War I.\n- The Battle of Verdun lasted from 21 February 1916 to 18 December 1916.\n- The Battle of Verdun was the largest and longest battle of World War I on the Western Front.\n- Émile Driant was the first high-ranking casualty of the Battle of Verdun.",
